To issue a Decision to verify the case showing signs of administrative violations in the electricity sector, the head of the electricity regulatory body must follow these steps:

1. Within 03 working days from the date of acceptance of the case, the head of the electricity regulatory body shall issue a decision to verify the case with signs of administrative violation.
2. The decision shall include the following contents:
   a) Date of issue of the Decision;
   b) The verification basis;
   c) Name and address of the inspected organization or individual;
   d) The person in charge of the verification;
   dd) The contents and the verification deadline.
3. The decision shall be in the form provided in Appendix 2 issued together with Circular No. 14/2014/TT-BCT.

By following these steps, the head of the electricity regulatory body can properly issue a Decision to verify the case showing signs of administrative violations in the electricity sector.

